<title>JAPAN: MOF to offer 10-year JGBs on Tuesday - MOF source.</title>
<headline>MOF to offer 10-year JGBs on Tuesday - MOF source.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance will offer 10-year Japanese government bonds on Tuesday, a MOF source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The amount of the issue is expected to be about one trillion yen, traders said.</p>
<p>Bond traders said the coupon is likely to be set at a record low of 2.8 percent, compared with 2.9 percent in the previous auction.</p>
</text>
